id: SCA-024
title: GitHub Actions download-artifact poisoning risk
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: presence
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: download-artifact
patterns:
  - regex: actions/download-artifact
    message: Downloading artifacts from untrusted workflow runs can introduce malicious files. Combined with workflow_run, a fork artifact can poison a trusted workflow.
fix: Validate artifact integrity (checksums) after download. Be especially careful when combining download-artifact with workflow_run from forks.
